          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 14.0px Helvetica;\">External: Spindle-shaped body; skin covered with pointed papillae; very small mantle through which shell protrudes; mantle on middle-anterior half of body; no divisions of sole (Schileyko 2003). </p> <p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 14.0px Helvetica;\">Internal: Flat, coiled internal shell; no jaw; long, twisted vas deferens joined slightly to the side of the penis apex; club-shaped penis containing a large verge with a coiled tip; long oviduct; very long spermatheca duct with a thick lower part; short atrium (Schileyko 2003). .</p>",
